    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/47c7d124bfad1c954f5f18154aebff94.poster.avif?t=1754674105\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/47c7d124bfad1c954f5f18154aebff94.webm?t=1754674105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/47c7d124bfad1c954f5f18154aebff94.mp4?t=1754674105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/1980f3fc1b7335e30270c3c8a0306614.poster.avif?t=1754674105\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/1980f3fc1b7335e30270c3c8a0306614.webm?t=1754674105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/1980f3fc1b7335e30270c3c8a0306614.mp4?t=1754674105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br> I remember a murder that I never committed. What if my memories were mixed with those of a real killer\u2026? I\u2019ll follow the trail of my false memory, reach the apartment where this murder was committed, find the real killer and free myself from the hold he has on my mind.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/2a43dd9ee1483dbb0c87febe3bb73cdc.poster.avif?t=1754674105\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/2a43dd9ee1483dbb0c87febe3bb73cdc.webm?t=1754674105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/2a43dd9ee1483dbb0c87febe3bb73cdc.mp4?t=1754674105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Explore</strong> abandoned places in this Silent Hill 2 inspired horror game,<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fight</strong> with weird looking monsters... or run away from them,<br>\ud83d\udcc4 <strong>Find</strong> and <strong>read</strong> documents, files, letters witnessing the past life of these places,<br>\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Solve</strong> puzzles, find keys and useful objects to progress deeper in the darkness.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/6a7508c528931b8582b00009754489b4.poster.avif?t=1754674105\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/6a7508c528931b8582b00009754489b4.webm?t=1754674105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/6a7508c528931b8582b00009754489b4.mp4?t=1754674105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br> Examine your environment and find some bills, inscriptions or letters that express the past life of the place. But is this building empty for real? Many disturbing phenomena are still happening in there\u2026<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/aeed8a95dff038da06b259ad32105117.avif?t=1754674105\" /></div><br><br> Story oriented: Characters sweetly nuts to meet, narrative cutscenes and original soundtrack.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/195f0de471dc757a3dd80f4502d139ca.poster.avif?t=1754674105\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/195f0de471dc757a3dd80f4502d139ca.webm?t=1754674105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/195f0de471dc757a3dd80f4502d139ca.mp4?t=1754674105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>My memories are not mine\u2026 Who do they belong to?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/ae8d5f740387a5a330a5e9b60aaf741d.poster.avif?t=1754674105\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/ae8d5f740387a5a330a5e9b60aaf741d.webm?t=1754674105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716330/extras/ae8d5f740387a5a330a5e9b60aaf741d.mp4?t=1754674105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
